		border-radius: 9px;
		outline: none !important;
		box-shadow: none !important;
		-webkit-appearance: none;
		appearance: none;
	}

	.custom-input-border {
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
